# Hotel Booking & Cancellation Analysis

## Project Overview
This project analyses hotel booking data to identify cancellation trends, booking patterns, and potential revenue impact.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX

## Key Features
- Total and cancelled bookings
- Cancellation rate analysis
- Average Daily Rate (ADR)
- Estimated revenue impact of cancellations
- Interactive Power BI dashboard

## Project Files
- `hotel_bookings.csv` – Dataset
- `analysis.ipynb` – Python analysis notebook
- `Hotel Booking & Cancellation Analysis.pbix` – Power BI dashboard

## Conclusion
This project provides insights into hotel booking and cancellation trends to support better decision-making.